Package: directAgeStd
Type: Package
Title: Direct Age Standardisation with Confidence Intervals
Version: 0.0.2
Authors@R: 
    person("Joe Blackford", email = "joseph.blackford@outlook.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides tools to compute directly age-standardised rates 
    using the 2013 European Standard Population. Includes variance 
    estimation and 95% confidence intervals for population health 
    applications. Functions are flexible to handle any grouping variable 
    and age bands, allowing reproducible and automated analyses.
